StudyMateX

Overview
StudyMateX is a student productivity application developed using React Native, Expo Router, Firebase Authentication, and MVVM Architecture.

Features
User Registration
User Login
Firebase Authentication
Password Reset
Home Dashboard
Study Resources
Focus Tracking
User Logout
Technologies Used
React Native
Expo
Expo Router
Firebase Authentication
TypeScript
MVVM Architecture
Setup Instructions
Clone Repository

git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/StudyMateX.git

Install Dependencies

npm install

Start Project

npx expo start

Firebase Configuration
Create Firebase Project
Enable Email/Password Authentication
Copy Firebase Configuration
Paste configuration into:

src/services/firebase.ts

Project Structure

src/
├── services/
├── viewmodel/
├── view/
├── model/

Authentication Flow

Signup → Firebase Authentication → Login → Home Dashboard → Logout

